{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音皆彌冥辨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音上桂下弘，實上離\n下加尸於彌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音暗實設又云塵坐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音順實順"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "少門道善作此說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音主為實他鳥而夫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寬平二年閏九月十一日追記之珍"}
